---
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-ivory-100 border-y border-charcoal-800/10" id="anatomy">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Visual Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md aspect-square rounded-sm overflow-hidden bg-ivory-200 border border-charcoal-800/10  p-6 flex items-center justify-center">
          <img
            src="/brand/logo-mark.svg"
            alt="CUMID Top Spiral and Page Geometry Diagram"
            width={300}
            height={300}
            class="w-3/4 h-3/4 object-contain"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 bg-charcoal-800/90 backdrop-blur-sm text-ivory-100 p-3 rounded-sm text-center text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold">Square Pocket Geometry</span> · Top-Edge Spiral Binding
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Copy Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-lavender-700">
            Thoughtful Ergonomics
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-charcoal-900">
            Why top-spiral and square?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
            Most notebooks are designed for broad office desks. We built CUMID for metro rides, tea stalls, bedside epiphanies, and spontaneous cafe scribbles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          <!-- Feature 1 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-sm bg-ivory-200 border border-charcoal-800/10 flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-lavender-200 flex items-center justify-center text-lavender-700 font-bold text-xs shrink-0">
              1
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal-900">Top-Edge Spiral Binding</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                By locating the wire coil at the top horizontal edge, your wrist glides across the page without colliding with metal rings. True ambidextrous ease for both left-handed and right-handed writers.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 2 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-sm bg-ivory-200 border border-charcoal-800/10 flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-peach-200 flex items-center justify-center text-peach-700 font-bold text-xs shrink-0">
              2
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal-900">Square Pocket Format</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                A balanced square form factor slips effortlessly into jacket pockets or small bags. The covers fold 360 degrees completely flat behind, acting as a sturdy handheld writing board on the go.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Feature 3 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-sm bg-ivory-200 border border-charcoal-800/10 flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sage-700 font-bold text-xs shrink-0">
              3
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-charcoal-900">Zero Pressure Pages</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-charcoal-700 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                Pocket notebooks aren't meant to be intimidating leather-bound tomes. They are low-friction companions for messy ideas, quick lists, and honest thoughts.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-700/60 italic pt-1">
          * Note: Paper weight (GSM), exact millimetre dimensions, and sheet counts are verified with the owner prior to batch production and never fabricated on this storefront.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
